        },
        "content": "**What is Lateral Movement?**\nOnce a hacker gets into a weak device (like a smart camera), they try to scan your entire home network to find computers or servers to attack next.\n\n*A device rapidly connecting to hundreds of other internal IP addresses is extremely suspicious!*"
