          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "**What is DGA?**\nDomain Generation Algorithms (DGA) are used by botnets to randomly generate thousands of weird website names (like `xkqj19zx.com`) so they can't be easily blocked.\n\n*High suspicious domains mean a device is likely part of a spam botnet.*"
      }
    },
